    m_MaxSize: 300
    m_Alignment: 0
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "* Credit goes to PurpleZaffre for the overworld sprites of Gardenia.\r\n*
    Credit goes to fersure4 for the overworld sprites of Misty.\r\n* Credit goes
    to HighNoonMoon for the overworld sprites of Burgh.\r\n* Credit goes to Lolw3e932
    for the overworld sprites of Grant.\n* Credit goes to Zed Kal Eios on The Spriters
    Resource for the custom battle sprites of Falkner, Jasmine, Clair, and Chuck.
    Credit goes to others on The Spriters Resource for several other sprites I used
    that are not custom, but were ripped from the original games.\n* Credit goes
    to the people who made and maintain Bulbapedia for always giving me tons of info
    about the official Pok\xE9mon games that I wouldn't have been able to reference
    in this game and make it accurately reflect Pok\xE9mon in general. I would've
    had to wing it with the specifics otherwise, and I'm pretty sure you have to
    be REALLY good at winging it to pull it off right, at least on a large scale
    like making an entire fan game based on the most successful franchise on the
    whole planet.\r\n"
