    m_Alignment: 0
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "* Credit goes to Game Dev Experiments (on YouTube and Patreon) for making
    the tutorials and some assets I used to create this game.\n* Credit goes to Chaos
    Rush, MrDollSteak, thedarkdragon11, and others on PokeCommunity for creating
    and managing all of the Generation 3-4 style Pok\xE9mon sprites based off of
    every Pok\xE9mon from Generations 1-9 so I could potentially include 1,025 Pok\xE9mon
    instead of only about 386 using the regular sprites from Generation 3 or something.\n*
    Credit goes to Ezerart on DeviantArt for the icon sprites from Generation 9.
    Most of the Pokemon had icon sprites on Pok\xE9Community, but there were a few
    icons that were missing, so Ezerart's extra icons helped.\n* Credit goes to aveontrainer
    on DeviantArt for providing the overworld sprites of most of the professors,
    as well as all the overworld sprites of many Gym Leaders in Flosha (the region
    this game takes place in)."
